[9] A gust of wind sliced through the fields, sending shivers down my spine. It whispered secrets of faraway places, of juicy mangoes in sun-drenched groves and sparkling rivers that flowed with crystal clear water. It promised me adventures on sandy beaches, maybe even a swim with a pod of playful dolphins! 

I don't think there was a lick of doubt in my mind… we were headed to the beach! 

Now, you just throw in a "Woof!" or a "Rrr-rrrrrrr-RRRRRR!" in a "**A-H-H-H**" kind of way, and you've got my loyalty for a walk on a lead, a day of chasing squirrels, and a whole lotta love to go 'Woof!'. 

